    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mark Lawlor is delighted to bring to the market 36 Bellamont View, a stunning detached property set within a highly sought-after and mature development. The property is offered to the market in turn-key condition and features bright and spacious living accommodation including four large double bedrooms and three bathrooms. A fantastic opportunity to acquire a forever home within close proximity of Cootehill town. \r\n\r\nComprising of a bright and spacious welcoming entrance hallway leading to a generous open plan kitchen / dining room filled with an abundance of light and access to a secure newly landscaped garden. The kitchen is a stylish fully equipped and with features modern fixtures and fittings. There is access to an airy utility room with doors leading to the outdoors and a convenient guest bathroom. The ground floor is completed with a bright and generous living room including a stove, overlooking the front lawns. \r\n\r\nSolid wooden stairs lead to four large double bedrooms. The main bedroom features a generous fully equipped ensuite overlooking the front lawns. There are three further double bedrooms, two with garden views to the rear, and one overlooking the front lawns. The upstairs is completed with a spacious fully equipped family bathroom. The property is A rated and has been fitted with an air to water system. \r\nOutside, the property is situated on a corner site and is approached on a tarmac drive. There are meticulously maintained gardens both to the front and the rear. \r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\nSituated in Bellamont View on the outskirts of Cootehill Town, number 36 is a short commute to major employers including Abbott and Manor Farm, while Kingspan in Kingscourt is just short commute further afield. There are a number of local schools, along with beautiful Erica’s Fairy Forest and Dartry Park. A host of sports facilities from a gym to GAA grounds and soccer facilities are nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\nHallway - 2.04 m x 4.60 m\r\nBright and welcoming entrance hallway. \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining room – 6.81 m x 11.09 m\r\nBright and fully equipped kitchen / dining room with access to a secure garden. \r\n\r\nLiving room – 4.51 m x 4.96 m \r\nBright and spacious living room with electric stove. \r\n\r\nGuest bathroom – 1.43 x 1.49 m \r\nGenerous guest bathroom including WC and wash hand basin. \r\n\r\nUtility room – 3.18 m x 3.31 m \r\nConvenient utility room off the kitchen.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\nMain bedroom – 3.53 m x 4.38 m \r\nBright and large double bedroom with convenient access to an ensuite, overlooking front lawns. \r\n\r\nEnsuite – 1.20 m x 2.72 m\r\nFully equipped ensuite, including shower, wash-hand basin and WC. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.14 m x 3.83 m \r\nBright and spacious double bedroom, overlooking front lawns. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 3.01 m x 3.89 m \r\nGenerous double bedroom, with views of the rear garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 – 3.11 m x 3.76 m \r\nSpacious double bedroom with views of the rear garden. \r\n\r\nFamily bathroom\r\nGenerous fully equipped bathroom with shower, bath, wash hand basin and WC."
      },
